      "size": [
        520,
        900
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 21,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Dialogue timing (sound guide)\n\nThe curve is *when people talk*: up = someone speaks, down = silence. It becomes a speech-like murmur, held for the first 30% of steps (**guide_steps 0.3**). Then the model writes the real voices, with the words from the prompt in quotes.\n\n**Change**\n- the **curve**: one plateau per line, gaps for the pauses.\n- the **prompt**: one quoted line per plateau, in order.\n- **guide_steps**: 0.3 works best. 0.2 lets speech leak into the gaps, 0.4 copies the murmur into the soundtrack.\n\n**Models** (official Comfy-Org files, also used by the MiniMax H3 templates):\n- `diffusion_models/minimax_h3_fl2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors`\n- `text_encoders/qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_int8_convrot.safetensors` (or the `nvfp4_awq` one on RTX 50-series)\n- `vae/minimax_h3_video_vae_fp16.safetensors`, `vae/minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors`\n\nFrom https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/MiniMax-H3"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
